/* OpenTab — English (base) localization.

   Keys are dotted and namespaced by surface. Adding a language means copying
   this file into <code>.lproj and translating the values; no code changes are
   needed, because every user-facing string is looked up through L10n.

   Strings that name a macOS feature (Spaces, Accessibility, Screen Recording)
   should keep Apple's own translation for that feature in the target language
   rather than being translated literally — users look for the name they see in
   System Settings. */

